                        "sentence": "Traje algo pa' que tú te relajes",
                        "targetHTML": "Traje algo pa&#x27; que tú <span class=\"fw-token-connector\">te</span> <span class=\"fw-token-v\">relajes</span>",
                        "translation": "I brought something for you to relax",
